sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant PS as Photon SMS number
  participant EL as ElevenLabs agent
  participant T as VoiceToolsRouter
  participant GS as GuidanceService
  participant W as PostCallWebhook
  participant IM as Photon iMessage line
  U->>PS: phone call
  PS->>EL: SIP INVITE over TLS
  EL->>T: get_session(caller_id)
  T->>GS: summary(session)
  GS-->>T: 2 of 7 done, next is step 3
  T-->>EL: say text
  EL-->>U: "You're 2 of 7 in. Put the charger, number 3, in bin A."
  U->>EL: "Done"
  EL->>T: mark_done(session, 3)
  T->>GS: markDone(claimed, voice)
  GS-->>T: next step 4
  EL-->>U: "Nice. Next, the pens, number 5, into the cup."
  U->>EL: "The cup's full"
  EL->>T: report_blocker(session, "cup full")
  T->>GS: reportBlocker
  GS-->>T: moved 5 to the drawer
  EL-->>U: "No problem, pens go in the top drawer instead."
  U->>PS: hang up
  EL-)W: post_call_transcription (HMAC)
  W->>GS: store summary
  W->>IM: send summary
  IM-->>U: "4 of 7 done. Next up: notebook. Send a photo to check."
